{{C|vo|Plants}}

==Volscian==

===Etymology===
From {{der|xvo|itc-pro|*gʷōs}}, from {{der|xvo|ine-pro|*gʷṓws}}. Cognates with {{cog|la|bos}}, {{cog|xum|bum}}, {{cog|grc|βοῦς}}, {{cog|sa|गो}}. This etymology is disputed, [[w:Blanca María Prósper|Blanca María Prósper]] argues that the Proto-Indo-European accusative singular {{l|ine-pro|*gʷṓm}} should have evolved into {{l|xvo|*bum}}, not {{l|xvo|bim}}. Other, controversial, proposals to rectify this concern are that the [[vocalism]] may have adapted itself to match {{l|xvo|sim}} or that {{l|xvo|bim}} may have merely evolved from {{l|xvo|*bum}}. 

Another theory holds that it may derive from {{der|xvo|itc-pro|*wīs}}, from {{der|xvo|ine-pro|*wéyh₁s}}, itself from {{der|xvo|ine-pro|*weyh₁-}}. If this were true, the term would be cognates with {{cog|la|vis}}, {{cog|sa|वयस्}}, and {{cog|grc|ῑ̓́ς}}. It has also been connected to {{cog|pgn|biam|t=[[sacellum]]}}, although hypothesis is not supported by the majority of linguists.

